docs {
  # Creates user session anonymization job

  The job anonymizes all user sessions in the specified timeframe by masking the specified fields.

  To identify user sessions to be anonymized you can specify either userID, IP address, an internal application ID or all of them. If you specify multiple criteria, the **OR** logic applies.

  You can't undo the anonymization.

  **Auth:** Api-Token only (OAuth not supported by this endpoint). Uses `{{DT_API_TOKEN}}`.

  **API token scopes:** UserSessionAnonymization
}
